WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.808
It's The Kids Tonight Show!

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:14.447
The first late night show for kids
and by kids!

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:16.783
Let's go!

00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:23.890
They just wanna know what kind of
car that I'm driving in.

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:28.395
Give a friend a new look?

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:29.462
Okay, let's do it.

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:30.497
Woah!

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:34.634
And the coolest celebrity guests ever!

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:40.106
What does Charli do that pushes your buttons
that she knows pushes your buttons?

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:40.907
I think she's a little–

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:42.842
I think they asked me the question.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:44.711
Wow!

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:46.112
On your marks...

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:48.481
get set...

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:49.816
go!

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:53.586
Well, congrats on being the
main character of Annie.

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:06.666
Oh my God!

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:09.002
I definitely don't feel cool enough
to be on this couch.

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:14.407
I'm not sure why none of you are in school
right now but we'll deal with that later.

